ini]], grated\n*Vegetable [[Cookbook:Dehydrated Broth|stock base]]\n*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n*[[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Cook the pasta as directed on the packaging. Drain.\n#Combine the eggs, milk, salt, and pepper in a mixing bowl.\n#Mix in the grated cheese.\n#Melt the butter and add to the mixture.\n#[[Cookbook:Boiling|Boil]] a small amount of water and add the stock, then stir it into the mixture.\n#Stir in the grated zucchini, then the drained pasta.\n#Grease a [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|baking]] or [[Cookbook:Casserole Dish|casserole dish]], and spread the ingredients from the bowl evenly in it.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at 200°C (400°F) for about 30 minutes, or until the pasta bake is firm all the way through.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta]]\n[[Category:Recipes using zucchini]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheese]]\n[[Category:Italian recipes]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for casserole]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cow milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Zucchini Pasta Bake","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"400 g any small pasta","sourceText":"400 g any small pasta","amountText":"400 g any small pasta","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"250 g cheese, grated","sourceText":"250 g cheese, grated","amountText":"250 g cheese, grated","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 eggs","sourceText":"2 eggs","amountText":"2 eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"200 ml milk","sourceText":"200 ml milk","amountText":"200 ml milk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"50 g butter","sourceText":"50 g butter","amountText":"50 g butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"3 m